{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1458913584"}, "name":{"label":"charl.cymru"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-08-07T14:26:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"10231244118"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing"}, "content":{"label":"Great idea!! I get so distracted whenever I pick up my phone. Automatically go to social media even if that’s not the reason I went on my phone in the first place. Being able to pause and think twice is everything in this day and age. Just taking a deep breathe helps so much with my anxiety! I’m grateful that my friend put my onto this app. Setting up wasn’t the easiest but also doable if you just minimize the app screen as the video is playing. \nThanks!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1360414712"}, "name":{"label":"sara wibble"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-08-05T06:11:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"10222439012"}, "title":{"label":"scam."}, "content":{"label":"i was suspicious of this app at first and i’m glad i was!\ni decided to enable notifications to tell me when this app was running on my phone without my knowledge, obviously ignoring when i was actually using the app. \nturns out this app runs whoever it wants even when i’m not using it or even have it open whenever it wants and i got notifications every time it tried to scam/hack me. not sure it was happening but i know i can’t trust an app that’s doing that. not to mention that the app told me to switch the notifications off. app for idiots i suppose.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
