{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id137853204"}, "name":{"label":"AlexNegueruela"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-07-30T04:21:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"10199105066"}, "title":{"label":"Love it"}, "content":{"label":"Does what it says. It has many more features but I only use the main one: preventing me from opening Twitter, Facebook and Instagram just on impulse. And just for that it’s totally worth the £9.99 a year. It’s not just the time you save, it’s your mental health and mental space.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1502460887"}, "name":{"label":"DDT_54"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-07-27T09:14:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"10188387451"}, "title":{"label":"Helps fantastic with productivity!"}, "content":{"label":"Often I find myself struggling with focusing on a long task and end up drifting away into my phone far too easily when I want a break. This app has been a great way to control the use of my time appropriately rather that mind numbing scrolling.\n\nI’ve only been using this app for one day and already have found that my productivity has increased. It’s very easy to navigate once you’ve got it up and running, no problems as of yet.\n\nI’m utilising this app that integrates to a planner app that I also use and found this to be a seamless process.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id502949779"}, "name":{"label":"Alex Turkin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-07-09T23:52:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"10123539447"}, "title":{"label":"That really works!"}, "content":{"label":"App's approach to increase friction of running certain apps by just introducing \"wait time\" - really works for me, I didn't expect it would be that powerful.  I feel like now I am using my phone, not my phone using me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1541949117"}, "name":{"label":"danjo1804"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-24T10:18:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"10068291947"}, "title":{"label":"Timer feature pls (eg prompt every 5mins on app)"}, "content":{"label":"This works great\n\nHowever once you bypass the block then it’s easy to still drain time on an app - any chance you can make a feature in which the app pops up after every X mins spent on an app?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1361367765"}, "name":{"label":"leepegnaro"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-23T02:23:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"10063443895"}, "title":{"label":"Great App for Preventing Procrastination"}, "content":{"label":"This app has really helped with stopping me open apps especially when I’m working on something (using structured). I have noticed an increase in my productivity as well as a decrease in my tiredness. The adult content block is amazing especially as it can stop you unlocking it. \n\n Sometimes I need to use apps that I would normally class as unproductive to complete a task. I would like the ability to unblock specific apps during specific structured tasks or block specific apps by color (similar to how it’s currently done with all apps)\n\nI would like the ability to block all apps and whitelist only the ones I want.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
