{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id13317388"}, "name":{"label":"Bix Beiderbecke"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-04-22T09:17:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.4.2"}, "id":{"label":"9849503271"}, "title":{"label":"Simple but pure genius"}, "content":{"label":"So much of what leads me to spend too much of my time on my phone is running on autopilot. Like millions of other people, I’ll absent-mindedly take out my phone, open an app, and before I realise what’s happening, bang go the next 30 minutes. This clever little app adds in a vital pause. Elegant, non-intrusive and a real boon to mental health.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1087886734"}, "name":{"label":"JayFelix31"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-04-19T02:53:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.4.2"}, "id":{"label":"9837726370"}, "title":{"label":"prob best app ever"}, "content":{"label":"in this age, everyone needs social media apps (such as instagram, snapchat etc) to communicate and everyone ends up getting sucked into the loop of endless scrolling. this app will help combat the endless scrolling and addiction to adult videos. there are no ads which is 🕺 and if you can't afford the paid version they'll help you out for free! honestly thank you whoever created this app. one thing i would like for the app to add is to disable tiktok clones like instagram reels or whatever the f that snapchat thing is called and also make a black and white feature that you can't disable for like 48 hours. the black and white feature will stop people from watching youtube cause they wont be able to see shiet", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1186277606"}, "name":{"label":"Fungamesonly!!!"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-04-16T14:57:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.4.2"}, "id":{"label":"9829579085"}, "title":{"label":"Stopped working"}, "content":{"label":"At first this was a great app! For 3 weeks I stopped using my phone too much and bought one sec pro. However it has randomly stopped working. Specifically the 4 apps which had one sec connected to them were not working anymore - Snapchat, instagram, tiktok, and YouTube. When I connected a different app through shortcuts to one sec, the automation worked perfectly. I double checked the automations are set up correctly. I fully updated my iPhone to the latest iOS. I deleted and reinstalled the 4 apps, one sec and shortcuts. I don’t know what the problem is? I hope this wasn’t a waste of money because I’d like this problem fixed.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
